WEBVTT

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.350
Autumn has finally begun in earnest.

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:37.570
And what else begins in autumn? Sports!

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:39.570
A ball game tournament?

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.990
Yes, it's this Sunday.

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:45.410
I'm burning with anticipation!

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:50.640
The ball game tournament and sports
meet are the two big events in fall!

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:53.050
Is this tournament really that big?

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:57.390
By the way, your anticipation 
is burning out of control.

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:59.660
There are all kinds of 
ball games, though.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:01.970
That's right. Which game is it?

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.980
Which game, you ask?

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.690
Dodgeball!

00:02:20.110 --> 00:02:24.120
<b>The Green Flame, Dodge Lee!</b>

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.540
Dodgeball?

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:29.440
What's wrong, Lee?

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.420
You don't sound excited.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.570
Do you not like dodgeball?

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:36.050
No, I wouldn't say I don't like it, but...

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.510
When I think of dodgeball...

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:42.430
So, how far are you in Narutimate?

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:45.850
I'm at the cave.

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:49.230
I'm at the Wind Tower.

00:02:49.230 --> 00:02:51.440
Whoa, really?

00:02:51.810 --> 00:02:55.030
Boys are so childish...

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:56.830
Childish...

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:59.510
It seems kind of childish to me.

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:03.910
It's not the dodgeball that's 
childish. It's the boys.

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:06.210
You're too soft.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:08.610
Even softer than these 
cream-covered dorayaki!

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:09.980
Stop eating that!

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.580
Your blood sugar will 
go through the roof!

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:13.330
Listen, Lee!

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.210
Dodgeball...

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:20.880
...is a deep game that tests the 
most fundamental ninja skills!

00:03:23.220 --> 00:03:24.900
It does?

00:03:24.900 --> 00:03:26.460
Clearly you don't see it.

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:27.770
Fine, I'll teach you.

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:28.980
Okay!

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:33.250
This exhibition match will demonstrate
the depth of the game of dodgeball!

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.840
<i>Guy Sensei, for a ninja,</i>

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.730
<i>handling a large object like 
a dodgeball is nothing,</i>

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:42.120
<i>especially compared to a kunai.</i>

00:03:42.120 --> 00:03:43.450
Come on, Lee!

00:03:43.450 --> 00:03:45.030
Oh, right.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:50.820
I'm sorry, I know face hits don't count.

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.640
Um, uh...

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:55.460
Guy Sensei?

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:00.700
Hey, kid, that was too rough!

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:03.980
Take it easy, would you?

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:05.140
<i>This again?!</i>

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:08.070
It was an accident!

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.810
I didn't mean―

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.560
Gotcha!

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:15.650
See that?

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:19.400
In dodgeball, if you let your guard
down for a second, you get hurt.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.740
The "dodgeball" part was finished 
way before he got hurt.

00:04:22.130 --> 00:04:25.660
A ninja must always secure his own safety,

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:29.250
and endure until his 
chance to strike comes!

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:31.230
That's the most basic part of being a ninja.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:33.080
What a fearsome game...

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.670
I never knew dodgeball was so complex.

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:38.130
How I can I learn to endure like that?

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.340
Visualize, Lee.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.510
See yourself dodging the ball.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:45.070
Okay, I'll try it!

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:46.650
That's the spirit!

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:47.750
Visualize!

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:48.760
Visualize!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:54.440
Our fall dodgeball tournament 
is finally underway!

00:04:54.840 --> 00:04:57.240
As always, I'm your play-by-play 
announcer Shizune,

00:04:57.240 --> 00:04:59.510
with Lady Tsunade on color commentary.

00:04:59.510 --> 00:05:00.360
Hello.

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:05.210
Our first match pits Team 
Guy against Team Ebisu.

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:07.820
You're going down, Mr. Bushy-Brows!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.950
Let's do this, Konohamaru!

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.740
Who do you give this 
one to, Lady Tsunade?

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.680
Five silver coins on Team Ebisu!

00:05:15.680 --> 00:05:16.710
You're betting?

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:19.100
Here goes!

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:22.690
Visualize, Lee!

00:05:22.690 --> 00:05:23.520
<i>Visualize...</i>

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:27.310
<i>Yes, I will undulate like a gentle
wave and gracefully dodge...</i>

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.680
Why are you relaxing?!

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.140
Here comes the ball!

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:38.730
Lee!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.150
You have to focus!

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.200
Why are you all nauseous?!

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:51.730
It's imaginary morning sickness...

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:54.080
You mean imaginary seasickness!

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:57.080
Time for Round Two, Mr. Bushy-Brows!

00:05:58.430 --> 00:05:59.550
I'll just have to...

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:00.900
...use the drunken fist...

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.530
I see right through you.

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:05.630
Sexy Jutsu!

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.430
Lee is out!

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.990
You're such an idiot!

00:06:19.990 --> 00:06:21.110
I'll get them!

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:24.940
Neji!

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:26.560
Gentle Fist,

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:28.900
Eight Trigrams, Sixty-Four Strikes!

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.030
Nice, Neji!

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:34.790
We're finished...

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:37.220
Team Guy wins!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:42.990
Things looked bad when Lee 
was eliminated early,

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:46.420
but they won a hard-fought
victory thanks to Neji's dedication!

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.850
What's your analysis, Lady Tsunade!

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.210
Just take it, you thief!

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.260
On to the semi-finals.

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:54.470
Team Kurenai!

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.140
Shino with a bug technique!

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:58.890
The ball has vanished!

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.810
This time, visualize!

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:05.940
Lee is out again!

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.000
Eight Trigrams Rotation!

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:13.660
And the opposing team is eliminated 
all at once again!

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:15.250
We're not done!

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:18.080
Severe Leaf Hurricane!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:21.000
There's no need to blow 
away the non-competitors!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:24.500
But Team Guy comes from 
behind and wins again!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.720
Argh! I'll win next time!

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:28.680
It's time for the finals.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:33.140
Team Guy vs. Team Kakashi 
for the championship!

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.640
We're taking this one, Bushy-Brows.

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:38.460
<i>I've been nothing but deadweight to the team.</i>

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.090
<i>I'm useless.</i>

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:41.470
Don't worry.

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:44.100
Just visualize and you can do it.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:46.320
You keep telling me that, but...

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.560
The match is about to begin.

00:07:48.560 --> 00:07:51.280
Which way are you 
leaning, Lady Tsunade?

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.440
Number 8 in the fifth.

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:55.030
You're betting on horses now?

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.200
Eat this!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:08:00.310
Special Big League 
Rasengan, Version One!

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:01.660
Whoa, what the―

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.290
Tenten is eliminated!

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:08.490
Tenten!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:09.910
I'm not done yet!

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.250
The same move won't work twice!

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:12.300
Byakugan!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.720
What a maneuver! He's mixed the 
ball in with his Rasengans!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.490
<i>Where's the ball?</i>

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:22.990
What a smart combination!

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:25.700
Naruto's Rasengans were 
just a distraction!

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.690
Eliminated

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:28.060
Team Guy is down to just Lee and Guy!

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:30.130
Team Kakashi is the real deal.

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:32.970
Lee is in deep trouble!

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:35.070
Don't give up, Lee!

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:36.980
Visualize.

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:39.080
You can do it! Visualize!

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:41.410
<i>Guy Sensei...</i>

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.040
<i>Visualize, visualize...</i>

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.110
I'm being persistent, aren't I?

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:47.920
But I'll keep on persisting!

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:49.510
<i>This is just like...</i>

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:51.330
<i>Oh, persist?</i>

00:08:52.110 --> 00:08:53.090
That's it!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.090
Get ready, Bushy-Brows!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.480
Big League Rasengan!

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:02.470
The Drunken Fist?

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.240
But it didn't work last time!

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:05.770
No!

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:08.230
That's no ordinary Drunken Fist.

00:09:08.600 --> 00:09:09.610
Lee!

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:12.440
Have you finally done it?!

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.540
One more!

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:18.020
One more round, Rock!

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:19.660
One more round, eh?

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:21.360
Come on, boss...

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:24.000
<i>Mr. Guy sure is persistent...</i>

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:27.310
<i>It's always the same, 
the bar by the station,</i>

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:29.170
<i>then another round at karaoke,</i>

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.040
<i>and finally a big bowl of ramen.</i>

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:32.460
<i>I have to escape...</i>

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:35.510
We're going all night, man!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:36.810
Um, Boss.

00:09:36.810 --> 00:09:37.590
Huh?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:39.660
Sorry, I...

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:41.890
You know, I've got that thing, and...

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:43.400
I gotta get home.

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:47.390
Wife's waiting for ya, huh?

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:48.980
I get it.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:51.100
Take care!

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:52.480
Yes, sir!

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.440
Sir! Sir!

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:55.980
He ducked it!

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:59.160
He ducked it like a man 
ducking a persistent boss!

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.120
Wait, that kind of ducking?!

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:03.620
That's it, Lee.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.340
Keep on ducking!

00:10:05.340 --> 00:10:07.330
Is this really the right 
lesson to learn?!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:10.080
Man, what an effective way to dodge!

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:11.480
I've got that thing.

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:12.460
I've got that thing.

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:13.810
I've got that thing!

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:14.970
I've got that thing!

00:10:14.970 --> 00:10:16.630
This makes no sense!

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:19.090
Why do you have to be a salaryman?!

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.930
Yeah, now counterattack Lee!

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:25.040
Be my guest.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.370
Many thanks.

00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:31.050
Balding Salaryman Whirlwind!

00:10:32.220 --> 00:10:34.930
We lost!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:40.780
Team Guy with another 
comeback victory...

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:43.030
Nice job, Lee.

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:44.650
I finally understand.

00:10:44.650 --> 00:10:47.960
Dodgeball isn't just a sport for kids.

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.000
It's a very adult-oriented game!

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.740
I don't think you understand 
what any of that means.

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:59.970
Fall sports are best enjoyed as a family.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:16.400
<b>New Year's Grift</b>

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.010
Anyone can make a mistake.

00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:14.100
Even the most respected
experts can be wrong sometimes.

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:16.400
What about this guy?

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.320
Den of Evil

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:22.160
Are you all right, Lord Orochimaru?

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:25.280
My plan failed again.

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:29.430
You kids
have fun

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:29.250
I dressed as an old man for 
"Respect Your Elders" day.

00:11:29.430 --> 00:11:34.670
Drink up, sing a song

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:32.440
I cared for an injured sparrow,

00:11:32.440 --> 00:11:34.670
got a wicker rice basket as thanks...

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:39.760
Fact and fiction

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:38.950
And tried to catch those 
greedy Leaf kids in a trap.

00:11:40.390 --> 00:11:44.570
But I forgot that "Respect
Your Elders" day was last week.

00:11:44.570 --> 00:11:47.970
They couldn't have cared 
less about an old man!

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.760
I think the problem is 
much more fundamental

00:11:50.760 --> 00:11:54.360
than getting the date wrong.

00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:56.310
Quiet, you!

00:11:56.310 --> 00:12:00.280
I don't need to be lectured 
by someone weaker than me!

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:02.930
Excuse me,

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:06.780
but with the way you constantly 
fail, I think I'm better―

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.300
You didn't say that.

00:12:09.300 --> 00:12:11.290
Tell me you didn't just say that.

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:14.500
What could you do better, 
you petulant pinhead?!

00:12:15.880 --> 00:12:18.000
Pin... head?

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.130
Who's a pinhead?!

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:24.590
That does it. I'll show you 
exactly how capable I am!

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:36.690
<b>The Yes-Man Says No!</b>

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:40.360
Look over there!

00:12:40.640 --> 00:12:43.320
You're my only friend...

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:45.970
Isn't that Orochimaru's underling?

00:12:45.970 --> 00:12:48.050
No doubt about it.

00:12:48.050 --> 00:12:50.580
He must be here to 
attack the Leaf again!

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:53.510
What're you doing here?!

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:56.270
Oh, it's you guys...

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.020
It's nothing.

00:13:02.270 --> 00:13:04.110
Is he okay?

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:05.970
Lee, he's our enemy.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:06.930
Stay on guard!

00:13:07.250 --> 00:13:11.370
You're right, but seeing him 
that depressed worries me.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:14.530
Hey, you can talk to us 
about it if you want.

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:16.600
Well...

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:19.570
You cut ties with Orochimaru?!

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:21.230
Yes.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:24.200
I just can't follow that path anymore.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:27.230
The way he uses his powers as a 
shinobi for such evil purposes...

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:28.700
It's just wrong!

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.820
So that's why you ran away.

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:32.820
Yes.

00:13:32.820 --> 00:13:34.540
I was thinking...

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:37.330
Would you let me join your group?!

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.390
A-Are you serious?

00:13:40.390 --> 00:13:45.280
I've always worked for him,
I don't know where to go now!

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:46.780
I'm a changed man,

00:13:46.780 --> 00:13:49.760
I just want to live an honest life, please!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.320
Even if that's true...

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:54.650
I know, but I do feel for him.

00:13:54.650 --> 00:13:56.270
If he's really changed...

00:13:57.730 --> 00:13:59.940
<i>They're such suckers for sob stories.</i>

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.980
<b>Kabuto's Ambition</b>

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:01.980
<b>The Path to Heaven</b>

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:04.990
<b>Youth</b>

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.990
<i>I join their group, 
get them to relax,</i>

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.310
<i>and slaughter them.</i>

00:14:04.990 --> 00:14:07.990
<b>Bloodbath</b>

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:12.740
<b>Wahahahaha</b>

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:10.340
<i>That's the plan.</i>

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.740
Ah ha, so that's what this is!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.160
<b>Fin</b>

00:14:14.610 --> 00:14:19.540
<i>I'll show Lord Orochimaru that
I'm even more powerful than him.</i>

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:20.340
Hold it!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:26.420
This guy used to be a double
agent working against the Leaf.

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:28.630
I don't think we can trust him.

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:30.340
<i>Very well.</i>

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:33.750
Indeed, I understand where 
you're coming from.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:36.570
But I swear I've changed.

00:14:36.570 --> 00:14:37.810
I'll prove it.

00:14:40.710 --> 00:14:41.290
Delete this photo?

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:42.520
Delete this photo?

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:43.590
Delete this photo?

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:44.590
Contact will be deleted

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:46.030
Deleted

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:47.850
How about that?

00:14:47.850 --> 00:14:49.250
How about what?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:53.330
You're just acting like 
a bitter ex-boyfriend!

00:14:53.820 --> 00:14:56.290
Nothing will change if 
we keep doubting him.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.810
If he's willing to go that far, 
let's give him a chance.

00:14:58.810 --> 00:14:59.970
Yeah?

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:01.290
If you say so, Lee...

00:15:01.640 --> 00:15:04.540
I don't like it, but I guess I'll go along.

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:05.210
Thank you!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:09.300
<i>They're so trusting, it's pathetic.</i>

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.220
<i>Now to make them lower their guard...</i>

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.900
All right, if you want to join our circle,

00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:15.560
you have to pass the test.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.970
Test?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:20.390
<b>Rock Lee Ninja Pal Application Test</b>

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:26.110
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.400
<i>I said I wanted to join their team.</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:31.070
<i>What am I doing in an exam room?</i>

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.110
The test is about to begin.

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:37.530
As you can see we've got 
a lot of applicants.

00:15:37.530 --> 00:15:41.910
But only one of you can become 
one of our ninja pals.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:43.540
Do your best, everyone!

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:47.000
<i>This is more like an audition.</i>

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.060
Everyone here today is very excited.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.510
They all assumed we'd be 
done after two seasons,

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:55.000
and they rushed in to try 
and ride our coattails...

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:58.770
...when they heard we were 
renewed for a third.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:01.090
<i>I'm not excited about anything!</i>

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:03.230
<i>Don't lump me in with these one-offs!</i>

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:05.890
You could at least leave a little 
of the fourth wall intact.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:09.190
Why do the guest characters 
even know that?

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:12.950
<b>Regular character's arrogance</b>

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:12.950
Anyway, I want to see just 
how determined everyone is!

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:17.780
<i>Whatever, I'll win at any cost!</i>

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.580
<b>Break</b>

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:24.330
Would the next five applicants
please come to the interview room?

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:25.540
<i>I'm up.</i>

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:27.250
Excuse me―

00:16:28.030 --> 00:16:29.710
What's Lord Orochimaru doing here?!

00:16:30.520 --> 00:16:32.930
<i>So you're here, too, Kabuto.</i>

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.890
<i>I see. So that's it...</i>

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.810
<i>I deduced your plan right away.</i>

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:41.180
<i>I'd expect nothing less, 
Lord Orochimaru.</i>

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.060
<i>So you had the same idea...</i>

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:44.870
<i>We're both trying to join them,</i>

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.980
<i>and strike when they 
least expect it, yes?</i>

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:50.500
<i>I accept your challenge.</i>

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:52.570
<i>Only one of us can win this contest.</i>

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:56.210
<i>And it's going to be me!</i>

00:16:57.560 --> 00:17:01.660
Let's see... First, tell us why 
you'd like to join the firm.

00:17:02.150 --> 00:17:03.550
<i>Firm?</i>

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:05.160
<i>What is this, a law office?</i>

00:17:05.160 --> 00:17:07.460
<i>Hold it. If I'm going to be accepted,</i>

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.670
<i>I have to play along.</i>

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.630
Go ahead, Mr. Kabuto Yakushi.

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:16.840
Yes, I feel like I can reach my 
full potential working here.

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:19.490
What textbook is that one from?

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:22.060
You could've said, 
"What is this, a law office?!"

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.950
and gotten a good 
punchline out of that.

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:26.870
We've already got a top-tier 
straight man in our firm.

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.700
Why do you keep saying "firm?"

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:30.650
Wait, were you talking about me?

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:31.530
See that?

00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:35.110
<i>Shoot, they wanted me to play 
along on a deeper level?</i>

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:37.200
Next applicant, please.

00:17:37.770 --> 00:17:39.160
Um...

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:39.980
Um...

00:17:39.980 --> 00:17:41.320
Err...

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:44.180
<i>He's too nervous to answer?</i>

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:46.830
<i>Good, Lord Orochimaru will 
lose points for that!</i>

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:48.540
Um, I―

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.010
<b>Department Store</b>

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.010
<b>Summer 
Sale{Z: Pretty sure these are right TL-wise}</b>

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.220
<b>Station</b>

00:18:06.430 --> 00:18:08.900
That's about how bad 
I want to work here.

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:11.200
<i>What kind of skit was that?</i>

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:13.900
<i>Expressing your desire 
like that is meaningless!</i>

00:18:13.900 --> 00:18:16.320
Wow, I really felt how badly 
you want to work here.

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:18.110
<i>What?!</i>

00:18:18.110 --> 00:18:22.180
Not only do I see how 
much you want this,

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:24.420
but that made for a great setup, too.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.750
Extra points for that.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:29.030
It's shocking. The amount of 
stupidity is just shocking.

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:32.670
Next, tell us a little tale about your skills.

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.840
I've got a lot of experience 
with medical ninjutsu.

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:42.260
My tail's a bit longer.

00:18:42.580 --> 00:18:45.490
That's quite a tale, indeed.

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:47.880
I see you're good with simple puns, too.

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.230
Extra points for that.

00:18:49.560 --> 00:18:52.520
Darn it. I shouldn't have 
played it straight!

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.690
Morons, you're all morons!

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:56.660
And now the elevator pitch.

00:18:56.660 --> 00:19:00.110
This is your last chance 
to really make an impact.

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:03.280
<i>Make an impact... What should I say?</i>

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:05.320
I'll go first.

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:05.870
What?

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:07.370
I win, Kabuto.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.350
This story will have such an impact,

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:13.090
they'll have no choice 
but to go with me!

00:19:19.090 --> 00:19:20.800
I won't die!

00:19:20.800 --> 00:19:23.470
Because I love yo―

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.860
What a heartwarming story!

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:35.420
He wanted to prove his love would even
protect him from death itself,

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:37.760
but in the end he was 
hit by a truck and...

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:41.280
Wait, that's the wrong kind of impact!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:41.280
<b>Impact</b>

00:19:42.520 --> 00:19:43.990
That was fantastic!

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:45.550
You played along at first,

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:47.630
and then nailed the punchline!
None of us could've done that!

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:51.830
Even our punchline wizard 
Tenten isn't that good!

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:53.830
What do you mean, wizard?

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:57.420
I give you a perfect score. You pass!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.670
Agreed.

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:00.920
Three points for Harataira!

00:20:00.920 --> 00:20:02.180
Why were they betting?!

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:05.850
I-I...　passed?

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:07.900
I admit defeat.

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.500
Lord... Orochimaru...

00:20:09.960 --> 00:20:14.200
Kabuto, when I said you 
were weaker than me...

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:15.810
I was bluffing.

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:20.790
I wanted to force you to step 
out of my shadow. That's all.

00:20:21.200 --> 00:20:26.160
You're a very strong man,
stronger than me.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:30.870
Lord...Orochimaru..

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:33.260
Good luck, Kabuto.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:39.040
I'm sorry. I had no idea!

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.760
But I understand now!

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.630
You have a much bigger 
heart than I ever will!

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:46.580
I'm quitting as your new pal.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:48.830
This was all part of my plan.

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:51.850
I was going to infiltrate your 
group and take you all out.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:55.300
But I'm going to beat you 
without any underhanded―

00:20:59.510 --> 00:21:01.470
You revealed yourself, Kabuto!

00:21:01.470 --> 00:21:03.090
Serves you right!

00:21:03.090 --> 00:21:05.840
Even if you hadn't quit, you'd still lose!

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:08.470
You think you're better than me?

00:21:10.790 --> 00:21:12.930
Why you...

00:21:12.930 --> 00:21:16.150
You were trying the same thing!

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:18.500
I could tell right away!

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:21.890
No fair! Outing me is 
against the rules!

00:21:21.890 --> 00:21:24.140
This is what makes you 
a petulant pinhead!

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:26.190
That again!

00:21:26.190 --> 00:21:29.670
I'm not a pinhead, you reptilian goon!

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:31.520
Moody brat!

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:32.890
What?!

00:21:37.360 --> 00:21:39.540
The total number who passed:

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:42.270
Zero!

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:45.030
Womp wah.

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:23.880
Next week is "My First 
Five-Star Sushi!"

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:27.420
<b>My First Five-Star Sushi!
Friendship, Effort, and Victory!</b>

00:23:23.880 --> 00:23:27.420
and "Friendship, Effort, and Victory!"

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:28.870
Five-star sushi...

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:32.180
So if it's not on a conveyor belt,
do we spin around instead?

00:23:32.180 --> 00:23:33.970
Of course not!

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:36.770
Only mature adults eat at 
sushi places like that―

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:37.790
Understood.

00:23:37.790 --> 00:23:39.650
So I should order squid,

00:23:39.650 --> 00:23:41.690
then change it to sea urchin,

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:43.240
and then eat the whole thing,

00:23:43.240 --> 00:23:46.070
and complain about the 
taste when I'm done!

00:23:46.420 --> 00:23:49.580
You're not supposed to abuse 
your power as a customer!
